Here's the problem file for turning on the TV with Robot 3:

```pddl
(define (problem turn_on_tv_problem)
  (:domain robot3)
  (:objects
    robot3 - robot
    Television - object
    TVStand - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot3 TVStand)
    (at-location Television TVStand)
    (not (inaction robot3))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (switch-on robot3 Television)
    )
  )
)
```

